page+='''</div><div class="kit-types"><div><h3>Archivo</h3><p>The display voice. Confident, compact headlines and the main wordmark.</p></div><div><h3 style="font-family:Instrument,sans-serif;font-weight:500">Instrument Sans</h3><p>The reading voice. Clear navigation, useful copy and practical information.</p><p class="arabic-sample" lang="ar" dir="rtl">اترك بصمتك.</p><p>IBM Plex Sans Arabic supports the Arabic website. Noto Sans Arabic remains available in the social editor. Font files and OFL licences are included.</p></div></div></section><section class="kit-section"><h2>In your pocket.</h2><p>Actual contact details, a WhatsApp QR and a compact 85 × 55 mm card. Artwork includes 3 mm bleed.</p><div class="kit-grid card-grid">'''+tile('business-card-front','Card front')+tile('business-card-back','Contact side')+'''</div><a class="button" href="brand/business-cards-print-proof.pdf" download>Download the print proof</a><p class="kit-note">RGB review proof. Your printer should confirm colour conversion, stock and finishing before a print run. The card includes the official digitsstudio.online website and the existing verified contact channels.</p></section><section class="kit-section"><h2>A feed that belongs together.</h2><p>Six 1080 × 1350 posts, plus ready-to-adapt English and Arabic captions. Use the editor to make the next post.</p><div class="kit-grid post-grid">'''
for name,title in zip(posts,['Launch','Branding','Websites','Marketing','Bilingual','Founder']):page+=tile(name,title)
